        <mxCell id="JOAAo7srWgzMx-nhyDmW-89" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:9px;&#39;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CrowdStrike ClientID/Secret hardcoded&lt;/b&gt; in main.go lines 792-794 — move to Secrets Manager&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;15-min timeout&lt;/b&gt; — multi-region Inspector2 report generation can be slow; monitor execution time&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;No unit tests&lt;/b&gt; — priority areas: CVE regex validation, DDB ops, CSV generation, error paths&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Google Sheets permissions can fail silently&lt;/b&gt; (line 266-267) — consider retry logic&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Jira creation failure logs but continues&lt;/b&gt; — processing doesn&#39;t halt on ticket creation errors&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Single-file design&lt;/b&gt; (~1000 lines main.go) — consider package refactoring if scope grows&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;fillColor=#FFF4C3;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=10;shadow=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
