        <mxCell id="xBpChCBXUIgInUoBrifL-90" value="&lt;b&gt;Data Fetch Pattern (every component)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:8px;&#39;&gt;① fetchAuthSession() → IAM creds&lt;br&gt;② Amplify.configure(amplifyConfig)&lt;br&gt;③ Amplify REST get(&#39;/getmetrics&#39;, {metricname})&lt;br&gt;④ Parse flat JSON (no .data wrapper — Gen 2)&lt;br&gt;⑤ setControlNStyle() for each control&lt;br&gt;⑥ detectChanges() (outside Angular zone!)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;fontSize=9;arcSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" parent="xBpChCBXUIgInUoBrifL-77" vertex="1">
