        <mxCell id="efOsK9inqy8JIb5-7ex9-48" value="&lt;b&gt;🔀 Edge Case Coverage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;Pre-defined handling for multi-category&lt;br&gt;URLs, conflicting group rules, defaults&lt;br&gt;— reduces LLM improvisation&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;strokeColor=#6a1b9a;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
